  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hu">Hu</ref> 3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And se man ðe ðis forsitte ⁊ ðæs hundredes dóm forsæce, ⁊ him mon eft þæt illce gerecce, gesylle man ðam hundrede XXX peninga ⁊ æt ðam æftran cyrre syxtig penega, half ðam hundrede, half ðam hlaforde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And whosoever neglects this, and ignores the authority of the hundred—and the charge is established against him subsequently—shall pay 30 pence to the hundred, and on the second occasion 60 pence, half to the hundred and half to his lord.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Si quis supersedeat et hundredi indicium reprobet, ut in eum denique recitetur, det hundredo XXX denarios et secunda uice LX denarios, dimidium hundredo, dimidium domino.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
